# DF MECHANICS rig (14z-101) — the maintainer's field pass confirmed DF
# activation/end and the graphics for all three tenants; MECHANICAL
# accuracy against native vs2 is the named unknown. This rig measures it:
# activate Dark Force with poked stocks, then go COMPLETELY IDLE so the
# mode's own timer runs out undisturbed — duration, cost and expiry are
# then rig-clean (no input can be feeding or ending the mode).
#
# Runs UNCHANGED on native vsav2 and on the merged build (the replay-85
# doctrine); the tenant/leg is chosen entirely by POKES:
#   P1 $FF8782 = the character under test (01 Demitri = the LEGACY
#       CONTROL — if legacy DF mechanics differ vsavj-vs-vs2, the
#       difference is FRAMEWORK, not a porting defect; 10/11/13 tenants)
#   P2 $FF8B82 = 0x03 Victor (same id both games)
#   P1 $FF8509 = 3 banked stocks at f3100/3120 (empty meter DOWNGRADES
#       the pair to a single button — the documented seq-0x0A trap)
# POKES="1400:ff8782:XX;1450:ff8782:XX;1500:ff8782:XX;1400:ff8b82:03;1450:ff8b82:03;1500:ff8b82:03;3100:ff8509:03;3120:ff8509:03"
#
# Instrument: tests/lua/field_trace.lua with
#   FIELDS=ff802e:b:df,ff8509:b:stocks,ff8508:b:m108,ff8507:b:m107,ff8406:b:p1seq
# The activation is HP+HK at f3260 (replay-85's measured-good frame);
# everything after is idle through f7000 so even a long DF expires
# in-window. If df==1 still holds at the last sample, the window is too
# short — extend the wait, do not read a truncated duration as a fact.
300-305 sys=C1
420-425 sys=C2
800-803 sys=S1
940-943 sys=S2
1100-1102 p2=R
1160-1162 p2=R
1300-1302 p1=1
1360-1362 p2=1
# activate Dark Force: HP+HK with stocks poked at f3100/f3120
3260-3263 p1=36
# then NOTHING — the mode runs out on its own clock
7000 wait
